      "domain": "packet_networking",
      "title": "packet networking method",
      "summary": "A packet network bounded a token-bucket arrival curve alpha(t)=sigma+r*t through a rate-latency service curve beta(t)=R*max(t-T,0), with r<R. Network calculus gave worst-case backlog as the maximum vertical deviation, sigma+r*T, and worst-case delay as the maximum horizontal deviation, T+sigma/R.",
